; LSI MegaRAID SAS (MFI) miniport driver (boot start: Setup and the first boot find the logical drives)
[AddReg]
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\megasas","ErrorControl",0x00010001,0x00000001
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\megasas","Group",0x00000000,"SCSI Miniport"
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\megasas","ImagePath",0x00020000,"system32\drivers\megasas.sys"
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\megasas","Start",0x00010001,0x00000000
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\megasas","Type",0x00010001,0x00000001
